SUMMARY:Autumn Equinox Cacao: A Candlelight Affair with Mars & Venus
DESCRIPTION:Star Sounds Asheville\nAutumnal Equinox Cacao: A Candlelight A
 ffair with Mars & Venus\n**Balancing the Cosmic Within**\n**Tuesday\, Sept
 ember 22nd 6:33-8:33PM**\nJoin David & Michelle at Quietude on September 2
 2nd as day and night kiss in equal measure\, holding the world in a breath
 taking\, breathless pause. At 8:04 PM (Exact Equinox) the solar fire mascu
 line season of active growth\, heat\, and outward light slowly surrenders 
 its crown to the lunar depth of the feminine energy\, ushering in reflecti
 on\, intuition\, and the quiet return to the earth. In this cosmic alignme
 nt\, action finds its stillness\, and giving meets receiving. All outer pl
 anets and Chiron will be in retrograde ushering Venus into her shadow phas
 e before she goes retrograde for 40 days. This will serve as a prelude int
 o reflecting on our personal relationships and our own underworld journeys
 . We will rest in a moment\, balancing our own inner fire and fluid grace 
 in order to step into the quiet\, grounding rhythm of the harvest moon and
  the darker half of the year.\nUnder the gentle glow of candlelight\, we w
 ill gather to contemplate the sacred romance within each of us. Together\,
  we will journey through the astrology of Mars and Venus. Through the hear
 t-opening magic of ceremonial cacao and the soothing vibrations of a mini 
 sound activation\, we will bridge these two powerful forces\, bringing the
 m into a state of peaceful equilibrium within ourselves.\nWhat to Expect:\
 n\n* **Candlelit Sanctuary:** Gather in a softly illuminated\, cozy space 
 designed to soothe the nervous system and welcome the quiet energy of autu
 mn.\n* **Ceremonial Cacao:** Sip warm\, pure\, heart-opening cacao to grou
 nd your energy\, heighten your awareness\, and unlock intuitive insights.\
 n* **Astrological Insights:** Explore how Mars and Venus manifest in your 
 life\, and learn how to balance your external giving with your capacity to
  receive.\n* **Cosmic Alignment:** Guided reflection and intention-setting
  to unite your internal masculine and feminine energies\, clearing the pat
 h for harmony in the season ahead.\n* **Mini Sound Activation:** Immerse y
 ourself in high-frequency sound waves designed to clear energetic blockage
 s\, integrate the cacao\, and harmonize your internal polarities at the ex
 act moment of the equinox.\n* **Deep Integration:** A peaceful\, grounding
  closing to anchor your intentions and transition smoothly into the reflec
 tive half of the year.\n\n**🙏Donations Start at $33 up to $55 Please gi
 ve what you can to guarantee your spot. You can Vemno @starsounds (last fo
 ur 6690)**\n**or credit card at** [Star Sounds](https://www.starsounds.lov
 e/event-details/autumn-equinox-cacao-a-candlelight-affair-with-mars-venus)
 \n**If $33 is to much\, just email David at [david@starsounds.love](mailto
 :david@starsounds.love) for a special price🙏**\nIf you prefer to make i
 t spontaneous\, you are welcome to show up and we will fill remaining spot
 s on a first-come basis. See you there\n\n### **About Your Guides**\n\n**D
 avid Heiss** is an Evolutionary Astrologer\, Sound Alchemist & Sacred Cere
 mony Facilitator who specializes in Self-Discovery. He helps reveal each p
 erson’s unique collection of stars and sound using a variety of insightf
 ul chart readings\, sound journeys\, fire ceremonies\, and immersive exper
 iences. David blends Gongs\, Crystal and Tibetan bowls\, plus many other m
 ystical instruments to cultivate conditions for healing and restoration. [
 https://www.starsounds.love/](https://www.starsounds.love/)\n\n**Michelle*
 * is an avid SoulCollage® Creatrix and lifelong educator who knows we are
  a network of connected humans. Michelle delights in nurturing and expandi
 ng ideas\, people\, and communities that are lighting up the world with th
 eir precious energy. She works with individual’s HighSelves\, offering a
  wide range of tools and experiences\, to facilitate self-reflection and a
 ccess to inner wisdom. Learn more [www.autumnhair.net](http://www.autumnha
 ir.net).
